# **Innovating with Purpose**™

#### Kraton at a Glance
* [Press Release][207]

  ## [Kraton Releases 2025 Sustainability Report][208]

  June 24, 2026
  Kraton Corporation is excited to announce the release of its 2025 Sustainability Report, titled
  “Strengthening Our Commitment to a Sustainable Future.” Highlights from the report include
  in-depth analysis of Kraton’s new sustainability targets, advancements in upstream and downstream
  supply chain sustainability, and Kraton’s ongoing commitment to sustainable business practices.
  [Read More Kraton Releases 2025 Sustainability Report][209]
* [Innovation Stories][210]

  ## [Advancing Sustainable Performance in Hot-Applied Road Markings][211]

  March 10, 2026
  As part of their carbon reduction strategy, WJ was looking for a partner to supply bio-based
  alternatives to hydrocarbon (HC) resins while delivering excellent performance for their
  hot-applied formulations.
  [Read More Advancing Sustainable Performance in Hot-Applied Road Markings][212]
* [Press Release][213]

  ## [KRATON APPOINTS SANGWOO RYU AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER][214]

  February 6, 2026
  Kraton Corporation announces the appointment of Sangwoo Ryu as Chief Executive Officer (CEO).
  [Read More KRATON APPOINTS SANGWOO RYU AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER][215]
* [[Aerial image of Kraton's Panama City, Florida, United States manufacturing plant. The plant is
  located along the water and is accessible by rail and truck.]][216]
  [Press Release][217]

  ## [Kraton Receives ISCC PLUS Certification for Its Panama City Manufacturing Facility][218]

  January 29, 2026
  Kraton Corporation is proud to announce that its manufacturing facility in Panama City, Florida,
  United States, has achieved International Sustainability and Carbon Certification (ISCC) PLUS.
  [Read More Kraton Receives ISCC PLUS Certification for Its Panama City Manufacturing
  Facility][219]
* [Press Release][220]

  ## [Kraton Announces New 2032 Climate and Resource-Efficiency Targets][221]

  November 10, 2025
  Kraton announced new long-term sustainability targets for carbon emissions, water use, and waste
  reduction. These targets reflect Kraton’s continued commitment to building a sustainable business
  model that creates long-term value for customers, partners, and communities.
  [Read More Kraton Announces New 2032 Climate and Resource-Efficiency Targets][222]
* [News Article][223]

  ## [Scaling Sustainability: How Industry Leaders Are Rethinking Resources Together][224]

  September 25, 2025
  Joining forces in strategic partnership, bringing together the expertise to develop
  next-generation packaging solutions.
  [Read More Scaling Sustainability: How Industry Leaders Are Rethinking Resources Together][225]
* [Press Release][226]

  ## [Kraton Corporation Receives EcoVadis Platinum Award for Sustainability Excellence for Fifth
  ## Consecutive Year][227]

  September 18, 2025
  Kraton Corporation announces that it has maintained its EcoVadis Platinum rating for its
  sustainability management system.
  [Read More Kraton Corporation Receives EcoVadis Platinum Award for Sustainability Excellence for
  Fifth Consecutive Year][228]
* [Press Release][229]

  ## [Kraton and International Paper Execute Strategic Continuity of Services Agreement][230]

  August 21, 2025
  Kraton Corporation announced the execution of agreements with International Paper, a global leader
  in sustainable packaging solutions, to maintain uninterrupted site services at Kraton’s Savannah,
  Georgia facility.
  [Read More Kraton and International Paper Execute Strategic Continuity of Services Agreement][231]
* [News Article][232]

  ## [Kraton Joins CERISEA Project to Advance Biobased Innovation][233]

  July 15, 2025
  As one of just 12  selected to participate, Kraton has been awarded a share of the grant to
  support the project’s R&D efforts focused on commercializing 5-HMF.
  [Read More Kraton Joins CERISEA Project to Advance Biobased Innovation][234]
